{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":97,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"1fbd607b-ea14-486e-9eaf-f197f5e973a5","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151093421,"PostDateInt":1761568852000,"PostDate":"2025-10-27T20:40:52","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"layout工程师(J10244)","OrgId":891377,"Org":"硬件开发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市·南山区"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、PCB设计与优化：负责复杂多层PCB（4层及以上）的布局布线设计，确保满足电气性能、信号完整性、电源完整性和EMC要求。\n2、能熟练使用EDA工具（如Cadence Allegro）进行DRC和ERC检查，确保设计符合制造和电气要求。\n3、EMC/EMI设计优化：采取EMC/EMI防护措施，如屏蔽、滤波、接地设计等，确保产品通过EMC认证。\n4、设计文档输出：输出Gerber文件、钻孔文件、装配图等生产文件，确保设计可制造性。\n5、与硬件工程师、结构工程师、SI/PI工程师等紧密合作，确保PCB设计满足系统需求。","Require":"1、电子工程、通信工程、自动化等相关专业本科及以上学历。\n2、5年以上PCB Layout设计经验，具备复杂多层板（4层及以上）设计经验。\n3、熟练掌握Cadence Allegro设计工具，对高速电路设计原则有深入理解，能够解决信号完整性、电磁兼容性（EMC/EMI）、电源分布网络（PDN）等方面的问题。具备多层板设计经验，熟悉不同类型的材料及其对电气性能的影响。了解机械设计基础，能与机械工程师协作进行PCB的物理布局设计。\n4、良好的团队合作精神，能够在跨职能团队中有效沟通。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-10-27T20:40:52","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"3c02e356-ba6b-4057-97f4-bd945f1a35d4","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151093419,"PostDateInt":1761568852000,"PostDate":"2025-10-27T20:40:52","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"SLAM算法工程师(J10251)","OrgId":2886356,"Org":"算法与智能部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市·南山区"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"岗位职责：\n1.算法研发与创新：负责机器人激光/视觉SLAM算法的研发与迭代，包括大规模场景下的实时建图、长期定位与地图动态更新等关键技术。\n2.多传感器融合：设计并实现基于激光雷达、IMU、视觉相机等多传感器的融合定位方案，提升系统在复杂环境下的精度与鲁棒性。\n3.系统集成与落地：负责将SLAM算法在真实机器人平台上进行集成、测试与性能优化，推动算法方案在产品中大规模、高可靠性地落地应用。\n4.技术前瞻探索：探索语义SLAM、空间智能等前沿技术，提升机器人的环境感知与交互决策能力。","Require":"任职要求：\n1.硕士及以上学历，特别优秀者可适当放宽，机器人学、计算机、自动化、电子信息等相关专业。\n2.熟练使用C++，具备扎实的编程功底和良好的软件工程习惯；熟悉ROS/ROS2机器人操作系统。\n3.深入理解SLAM/VIO基本原理，熟悉前端里程计、后端优化、回环检测等核心模块。熟悉主流SLAM框架（如LIO-SAM, FAST-LIO, VINS, ORB-SLAM等），有实际工程经验并了解其优劣与适用场景。\n4.具备扎实的数学基础，熟练掌握非线性优化理论、卡尔曼滤波、李群李代数在SLAM中的应用。\n5.有机器人/无人车定位导航项目批量落地经验者优先。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4Extern