Score":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-10-27T20:40:52","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"fbbde283-19b1-4df8-9651-29b3c8259ca4","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151093416,"PostDateInt":1761568852000,"PostDate":"2025-10-27T20:40:52","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"轮式底盘MCU工程师(J10258)","OrgId":891378,"Org":"嵌入式开发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市·南山区"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、负责轮式底盘控制器（MCU）的嵌入式软件设计、开发、调试与维护。\r\n2、参与电机控制、PID调速、里程计融合、轮速测量、编码器读取等底盘控制逻辑的实现。\r\n3、协同硬件工程师完成底盘MCU的电路设计评审和原型验证。\r\n4、实现与上位机或主控板之间的通讯协议（如CAN、UART、RS485等）。\r\n5、支持底盘系统的功能测试、问题定位与性能优化。\r\n6、撰写相关的技术文档与接口说明。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，电子、自动化、机器人、通信等相关专业。\r\n2、熟悉常见MCU平台（如STM32、GD32 等），有实际嵌入式开发经验。\r\n3、熟悉电机控制算法（BLDC/有刷/无刷直流电机控制），了解FOC、PWM等控制技术。\r\n4、掌握C/C++编程，了解嵌入式实时系统开发。\r\n5、有CAN、UART、SPI、I2C等通信协议的开发经验。\r\n6、有良好的调试习惯，能使用示波器、逻辑分析仪等调试工具。\r\n7、工作积极主动，具备良好的团队协作能力和沟通能力。\r\n加分项：\r\n1、有移动机器人、AGV、AMR 或无人车相关项目经验；\r\n2、熟悉FreeRTOS、RT-Thread等实时操作系统；\r\n3、有整机系统集成经验者优先；\r\n4、有硬件基础者优先（如能看懂电路图、动手焊接、调试硬件）；","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4Rewa