解。\r\n4、具备优秀的沟通表达能力，逻辑思维能力和有效解决问题能力；具备强烈的责任心，工作态度积极主动，注重团队合作。\r\n5、有PMP等项目管理证书者优先。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"2年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-10-27T20:40:52","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"1edb9dd9-1b55-4ee5-9309-68710fd1a1e0","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151093413,"PostDateInt":1761568852000,"PostDate":"2025-10-27T20:40:52","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"高级前端工程师(J10256)","OrgId":891379,"Org":"软件开发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市·南山区"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 机器人控制软件日常开发和维护，对团队产出的质量和效率负责。\r\n2. 软件项目使用体验升级优化，新立项软件项目技术选型，并且执行落地。\r\n3. 软件跨平台方案技术规划，并且执行落地。\r\n4. 人型机器人行业软件前沿技术与框架的调研探索。","Require":"1. 5年以上前端开发经验，有大型项目开发经验优先。\r\n2. 有全栈开发经验，能打通前后端技术栈，熟悉PC端、移动端、Web端的跨平台技术方案。\r\n3. 精通Nodejs、Electron、Flutter、ReactNative其中一项及以上。\r\n4. 有机械臂/AGV/人型机器人行业经验优先。\r\n5. 积极乐观，责任心强，工作认真细致，具备良好的服务意识，具有良好的团队沟通与协作能力。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"5年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-10-27T20:40:52","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"ebf9724a-9a0b-4bd6-b987-2e7216e7b17e","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151093412,"PostDateInt":1761568852000,"PostDate":"2025-10-27T20:40:52","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"轮式机器人底盘机械设计工程师(J10253)","OrgId":891376,"Org":"机械结构开发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市·南山区"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、负责轮式机器人底盘的结构设计、传动系统开发及整机集成，从概念设计到量产落地的全流程开发。  \r\n2、完成底盘运动学/动力学仿真分析，优化轮系布局、悬架系统、减震机构及驱动模块设计。\r\n3、完成非标零部件（如差速轮、麦克纳姆轮系统、减震杠杆机构）的创新设计及可靠性验证。\r\n4、协调跨部门资源，主导样机组装、测试及问题整改，解决量产过程中工艺、装配及材料问题。\r\n5、编写技术文档（BOM、装配工艺、测试标准）及专利文件，推动设计创新与技术沉淀。\r\n6、跟踪机器人行业前沿技术，探索低成本、高适应性底盘解决方案。","Require":"1、学历专业：\r\n机械工程、车辆工程、自动化等相关专业本科及以上学历。\r\n2、工作经验：  \r\n3年以上机器人/自动化设备机械设计经验，至少主导过2个轮式/足式机器人底盘完整项目（AGV、AMR、人形机器人等）。\r\n熟悉差速轮系、麦克纳姆轮、舵轮等驱动方案，精通悬架系统、减震机构及传动系统设计。\r\n3、技术能力：  \r\n精通机加工（CNC、钣金、焊接）、材料选型（金属/复合材料）及表面处理工艺。\r\n熟练使用Creo完成复杂装配体设计，掌握ANSYS/Adams等仿真工具。\r\n具备量产经验，熟悉DFM（可制造性设计）及成本控制逻辑。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-10-27T20:40:52","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"7eb13f57-9d2f-49bd-8c87-7b77a244f0ce","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151093411,"PostDateInt":1761568852000,"PostDate":"2025-10-27T20:40:52","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"高级机器人软件产品经理(J10262)","OrgId":891382,"Org":"产品规