de":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"886917c6-4e47-4f3d-8439-511d91d27361","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151093407,"PostDateInt":1761568852000,"PostDate":"2025-10-27T20:40:52","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"电气工程师(J10272)","OrgId":891370,"Org":"解决方案开发部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市·南山区"],"Salary":"15K-20K 元/月","Duty":"1.独立完成电工基础操作；\n2.独立完成电气部件选型，电气图纸设计；\n3.独立完成PLC编程、触摸屏界面组态设计，并参与设备的现场调试，能分析并处理现场故障；\n4.自动化设备生产过程的指导，使用说明书制作，参与售后技术支持；\n5.完成上级领导安排的临时工作。","Require":"1.本科学历，机电、电气自动化相关专业，3年及其以上独立编程调试经验；\n2.能够独立完成电路图出图，BOM清单整理；\n3.至少熟练三种PLC品牌中的一种，如西门子、汇川、三菱编程及调试；\n4.至少熟练三种HMI品牌中的一种，如威纶通、西门子、昆仑通态编程及调试；\n5.有过其中一种机器人（DOBOT、ABB、KUKA、安川、发那科、众为兴等）编程调试经验优先；\n6.有过模拟量、脉冲、定位控制、总线控制、视觉通讯的电气调试经验，熟悉常用的工业通讯，如PLC与上位机通讯，Modbus-RTU协议等基于485接口的主从通讯；\n7.对气动、电动及机械运动原理有相应的了解及基础；\n8.具有较好的沟通协调能力，责任心强，有良好的职业道德。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-10-27T20:40:52","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"88ccefc8-05ac-44d8-9420-a0aeebb638a4","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151093403,"PostDateInt":1761568852000,"PostDate":"2025-10-27T20:40:52","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"定位导航算法工程师(J10282)","OrgId":891375,"Org":"关键技术研究部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["浙江省·杭州市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"岗位职责：\n1.算法研发与创新：负责机器人激光&视觉SLAM算法的研发与迭代，包括大规模场景下的实时建图、长期定位与地图动态更新等关键技术。\n2.多传感器融合：设计并实现基于激光雷达、IMU、视觉相机等多传感器的融合定位方案，提升系统在复杂环境下的精度与鲁棒性。\n3.自主导航规划：研发机器人的运动规划与控制算法，包括全局路径搜索、局部实时避障，构建机器人的行为决策框架，确保机器人在动态环境中的安全、平滑导航。\n4.系统集成与落地：负责将定位导航算法模块在真实机器人平台上进行集成、测试与性能优化，推动算法方案在产品中大规模、高可靠性地落地应用。\n5.技术前瞻探索：探索语义SLAM、视觉语言导航（VLN）等前沿技术，提升机器人的环境感知与交互决策能力。","Require":"1.硕士及以上学历，机器人学、计算机、自动化、电子信息等相关专业。\n2.熟练使用C++，具备扎实的编程功底和良好的软件工程习惯；熟悉ROS/ROS2机器人操作系统。\n3.深入理解SLAM/VIO基本原理，熟悉前端里程计、后端优化、回环检测等核心模块。熟悉主流SLAM框架（如LIO-SAM, FAST-LIO, VINS, ORB-SLAM等），有实际工程经验，了解其优劣与适用场景。\n4.熟悉机器人路径规划、自主避障算法，如A*, D*, State Lattice, TEB, MPC等。\n5.具备扎实的数学基础，熟练掌握非线性优化理论、卡尔曼滤波、李群李代数在SLAM中的应用。\n6.有机器人/无人车定位导航算法项目批量落地经验者优先。\n7.加分项：具有语义SLAM、视觉语言导航（VLN）或相关方向的研究或项目经验。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"硕士研究生","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRec